<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:36:30 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>寒流威胁冬季供应紧张，欧洲天然气价格飙升</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/european-gas-surges-as-cold-snap-threatens-supplies-video</link><description>欧洲天然气价格大幅上涨，原因是天气前景急剧寒冷加剧了人们对欧洲冬季供应的担忧，而欧洲冬季供应已经受到与美伊战争有关的出口中断的压力。乔·沃茨报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/european-gas-surges-as-cold-snap-threatens-supplies-video'&gt;寒流威胁冬季供应紧张，欧洲天然气价格飙升&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：European Gas Surges as Cold Snap Threatens Tight Winter Supplies&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/european-gas-surges-as-cold-snap-threatens-supplies-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:51:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>现在对于人工智能行业来说真正重要的是什么？现场问答</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/sessions/2026-11-24/live-q-amp-a-is-the-ai-boom-too-dependent-on-nvidia</link><description>从黄仁勋回归英伟达到人工智能行业的波动，彭博社记者今天下午 1 点在现场问答中回答您的问题。美国东部时间。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/sessions/2026-11-24/live-q-amp-a-is-the-ai-boom-too-dependent-on-nvidia'&gt;现在对于人工智能行业来说真正重要的是什么？现场问答&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：What Really Matters for the AI Trade Now? Live Q&amp;A&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/sessions/2026-11-24/live-q-amp-a-is-the-ai-boom-too-dependent-on-nvidia</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:56:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>伊拉克拒绝欧佩克+对其石油生产能力的评估</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/iraq-rejects-opec-assessment-of-its-oil-production-capacity</link><description>据知情人士透露，伊拉克拒绝了欧佩克+委托对其石油产能进行的评估，这可能会在本周末的重要生产目标会议上发生冲突。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/iraq-rejects-opec-assessment-of-its-oil-production-capacity'&gt;伊拉克拒绝欧佩克+对其石油生产能力的评估&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Iraq Rejects OPEC+ Assessment of Its Oil Production Capacity&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/iraq-rejects-opec-assessment-of-its-oil-production-capacity</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:04:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Nvidia、Anthropic 遭受重创，纳斯达克 100 指数下跌：市场休整</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>由于对人工智能贸易持久性的怀疑，股市下跌，华尔街也在解析有关美国新关税的讨论。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;Nvidia、Anthropic 遭受重创，纳斯达克 100 指数下跌：市场休整&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Sinks as Nvidia, Anthropic Get Hammered: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:06:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于投资者权衡美联储前景和股市抛售，金价暴跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-gain-after-nvidia-s-rehiring-of-huang-sparks-rally</link><description>由于白宫最新的关税计划推低股市，投资者考虑进一步加息，金价下跌，抹去了周一大幅反弹的大部分内容。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-gain-after-nvidia-s-rehiring-of-huang-sparks-rally'&gt;由于投资者权衡美联储前景和股市抛售，金价暴跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Slumps as Investors Weigh Fed Outlook, Stocks Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-gain-after-nvidia-s-rehiring-of-huang-sparks-rally</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:06:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>加拿大央行行长警告石油传递和粘性通胀</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/bank-of-canada-chief-warns-of-oil-passthrough-sticky-inflation</link><description>加拿大央行行长警告称，由于经济表现好于官员预期，油价上涨将转嫁给消费者。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/bank-of-canada-chief-warns-of-oil-passthrough-sticky-inflation'&gt;加拿大央行行长警告石油传递和粘性通胀&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bank of Canada Chief Warns of Oil Passthrough, Sticky Inflation&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/bank-of-canada-chief-warns-of-oil-passthrough-sticky-inflation</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:25:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>脆皮鸡和改造让麦当劳与特许经营商展开竞争</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/mcdonald-s-remodel-pits-company-against-franchisees-video</link><description>特许经营权所有者正在抵制首席执行官耗资数十亿美元的拆除墙壁、增加大屏幕和制作手工面包鸡肉的计划。彭博社记者 Daniela Sirtori 报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/mcdonald-s-remodel-pits-company-against-franchisees-video'&gt;脆皮鸡和改造让麦当劳与特许经营商展开竞争&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Crispier Chicken and Remodels Pit McDonald's Against Franchisees&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/mcdonald-s-remodel-pits-company-against-franchisees-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:25:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>调查发现，纽约市 21 岁以下的 Kalshi 用户损失了 890 万美元</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth</link><description>根据 Kalshi 向纽约市议会发布的内部数据，纽约市有超过 50,000 名 18 岁至 21 岁之间的人在使用 Kalshi，他们正在以不成比例的速度亏损。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth'&gt;调查发现，纽约市 21 岁以下的 Kalshi 用户损失了 890 万美元&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Kalshi Users Under 21 Lost $8.9 Million in NYC, Probe Finds&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:21:17 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>